???: Hey! There you are!

<<pan Camera Heart>>
HEART: Mind! There you are, I thought I lost you again!

<<pan Camera Mind>>
MIND: Looking for...something.
MIND: My crown...it's gone. It has been stolen, most likely by some miscreant to sell.

<<pan Camera Heart>>
HEART: I doubt anyone would want that old thing. Come on, let's get moving. I'll help you find it, okay?
<<pan Camera Mind>>
MIND: Fine. I suppose four eyes are better than two. Just...don't make things worse. I know how reckless you are.
<<pan Camera Heart>>
HEART: You know that you enjoy my company! You’re just too grumpy to admit it. Besides, maybe being “reckless” is the push you need to find the crown, hm?

<<pan Camera Mind>>
MIND: Let’s just get a plan up and running. The thieves couldn’t have gotten far. Without the crown, I cannot use my usual entrance. We will have to take the long way.

